/// The form in which a cell's formula is carried.
///
/// The `display_string` form is the one to write: it's the only one a reader
/// resolves in version 1.0. An `id_based` formula is accepted, but its
/// references aren't substituted into the expression, so it reaches the reader
/// with its placeholder tokens intact.
