/// The granularity of a fraction display.
///
/// It's either a maximum digit count for the numerator and denominator, or a
/// fixed denominator such as halves or quarters.
enum Accuracy(@override final String wireValue) implements WireEnum {
  /// A value that marks a range of cells with mixed fraction accuracies. It's
